<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav Feb oil output falls to 76,000 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav Feb oil output falls to 76,000 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV CRUDE PETROLEUM     FEB 97     JAN 97     FEB 96</p>
<p> crude petroleum (tonnes)     76,000     84,000     81,000</p>
<p> natural gas (million cu.meters)	48	   60	   33</p>
<p>NOTE -- Data refers to Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro.</p>
<p>-- Beti Bilandzic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 2224305</p>
</text>
